- Update to version 2.75.0:
  * Add the Gemini 3.8 Flash model: multimodal image-to-text with
    vision and a low/medium/high --thinking
- Update to version 2.74.1:
  * Add the MiniMax H3 Max Turbo model: faster-than-realtime video
    from a prompt or a start/end frame, 5-15s at 480p or 768p
  * Retire --human-fidelity (--fidelity) and --static-mask, and
    narrow per-model surfaces: --resolution off Kling Video O1 and
    both Motion Controls, --rendering-speed off Kling V3 Omni
    (10 -> 7 reference images) and Kling V2.6, --image-weight off
    Kling V2.1 Image, --count off Qwen
  * Drop --cfg-scale from Wan 2.6 and with it Kling's 0-1 variant,
    which widens the merged range to 1-50; offer --seed on 18
    models instead of 5, make --duration a free range on six more
    models, add --audio-setting to Wan 2.7 Video Edit and rework
    the ElevenLabs --language and --voice-id surface
  * Reject locally rather than at the API: Kling Video Effects
    templates needing two reference images, Kling Elements without
    its video, Wan 3.0 with neither prompt nor media, an end frame
    without a start frame, frames or multi-shot with base editing
- Re-vendor: the package set is unchanged, the nine @inquirer/*
